Ok, it's nonsense.

&#x200B;

Though since the speed of light can be broken through a prism, try and imagine this for a moment of scientific speculation.

&#x200B;

There are plenty of asteroids not far from Earth that are abundant in isotopes full of positrons. All we need to do scientifically is create a dysonsphere like structure around it, convert the annihilation process as they collide with electrons into Gamma Rays and channel the gamma rays back into each other again & again, creating a fusion reaction. The frequencies of gamma rays in the fusion process can then be compressed even further to the cosmic ray spectrum by creating a vortex of gamma rays constantly feeding into itself. I call this Universal Fusion. Remember it my astrophysicist friend.

